    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Evaluation order per token (guards are mutually
exclusive, so this doesn't change the diagram - just
which check the code runs first):
  1. header-name token produced --&gt; NONE
  2. token.at_line_start --&gt; AFTER_HASH or NONE
  3. otherwise: switch on current state (same-line)
bg=#FFF2CC</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
